  <Name>Pset_SoundPressureLevels</Name>
  <Definition>Definition from IAI: Sound pressure levels across eight octave bands specifying the amount of sound generation ot sound attenuation.

HISTORY: New property set in IFC Release 2.0.

ISSUES: No issues to date.</Definition>
  <Typed>False</Typed>
  <TypedClass></TypedClass>
  <TypeName></TypeName>
  <PropertyDefs>
    <PropertyDef id="679">
      <Name>63Hertz</Name>
      <PropertyType>
        <TypePropertySingleValue>
          <DataType type="IfcReal"/>
          <UnitType type="PressureUnit"/>
        </TypePropertySingleValue>
      </PropertyType>
      <ValueDef>
        <MinValue value="see type"/>
        <MaxValue value="see type"/>
        <DefaultValue value="0"/>
      </ValueDef>
      <Definition>
Sound Pressure Level measured in decibels at a reference pressure of 20 microPascals for the octave band frequency centered around 63 Hertz.
      </Definition>
    </PropertyDef>

